# Keyboard-First POS UI Standard

- Global Hotkeys:
  - `F2`: POS Counter / Quick Item Search
  - `F3`: Party Directory Modal
  - `F4`: Purchase Entry
  - `F7`: Payment / Receipt Voucher
  - `Ctrl + Enter`: Commit & Print 80mm Thermal Receipt
  - `Escape`: Cancel / Reset active input
- Fast-Entry Navigation: `Enter` transitions seamlessly across `Item -> Unit Toggle -> Quantity -> Rate -> Discount -> Add to Cart`.
- Anti-AI Aesthetics: Grounded neutral tones (`#F8F9FA`, `#FAFAFA`, `#F4F4F5`, `#18181B`), crisp 1px borders (`#E5E7EB`), monospace font for figures, zero emojis in headers/badges, and transitions under 150ms.
- 80mm Thermal Slip: Pure CSS `@media print` layout rendering in < 150ms without unnecessary browser dialog delays.
